This licence covers THIS PROJECT ONLY.

This project is a visualization and automation layer for GitNexus. It does not
fork GitNexus, does not modify it, and does not redistribute its source. GitNexus
is a separate project distributed under PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0 and
remains the property of its author, Abhigyan Patwari — see
https://github.com/abhigyanpatwari/GitNexus.

GitNexus is declared as a PEER, not a dependency: installing this project does
not install GitNexus, and nothing under that licence ships inside this package.
But **your use of GitNexus through this project is subject to GitNexus's
licence**: noncommercial use is granted, commercial use requires a separate
grant from its author. A
summary is in README.md under "License and what this project is not".
